e.\n- Modified typography styles, specifically the h2 heading, for improved readability and visual hierarchy.\n\nCloses #123", "created_at": "2024-06-15T14:37:03Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a9b8bb5a8ec7e794d4c90aae3a539f35e0423d68", "message": "refactor(navbar layout): improved UX", "created_at": "2024-06-15T14:36:40Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "afb62d64a77dfa9ba1e82429e2cf66133a3ce040", "message": "refactor: Update rich editor to react-quill and improve landing page layout\n\n- Changed the rich editor from tip-tap to react-quill for better functionality and user experience.\n- Added short gaps between components in the landing page to improve readability and visual separation.", "created_at": "2024-06-15T14:35:18Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1867c7feb239db5839530ab983dd3e33ece1eb69", "message": "Changed the rich editor from tip-tap to react-quill", "created_at": "2024-06-11T10:44:39Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "442c44ba9232f806ca124045ceb4228d1a6821d2", "message": "added short gaps between components in landing page", "created_at": "2024-06-10T18:26:21Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "8e8714c34d4ea91398284e8205776f042d7d4a8b", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/kilaniBarhoom/TTS-Frontend", "created_at": "2024-06-10T10:39:47Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7908e9beb4152f77fb050075a3310e11722e1e2f", "message": "Merge branch 'main' of https://github.com/kilaniBarhoom/TTS-Frontend", "created_at": "2024-06-10T10:37:22Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file