 "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b74ae5054b60b3e84c381bcdcb85bf1680ec676c", "message": "refactor: Update project and ticket cards for better responsiveness\n\n- Updated the project and ticket card components to improve responsiveness on smaller devices.\n- Added a children prop to the ProjectStatusBadge and TicketStatusBadge components, allowing for additional content to be rendered inside the badge.\n- Added grouping by status to the project cards on smaller devices.\n- Adjusted the CSS variables for the background and foreground colors in dark mode to improve visibility and aesthetics.\n- Improved the responsiveness of the ticket details header by handling loading state and displaying a skeleton loader when isLoading is true.\n- Updated the UI styles for better responsiveness, including the BreadcrumbItem component and main layout styles.\n- Made the dialogs responsive using drawers.\n- Removed unnecessary options in navigation calls to prevent unnecessary page replacement.\n- Preserved the open state in searchParam for tickets.", "created_at": "2024-06-03T10:16:51Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "69c7372a119f0d111f13037434cb608cfc4a0d51", "message": "refactor: Add children prop to status badges\n\n- Updated the ProjectStatusBadge and TicketStatusBadge components to include a children prop, allowing for additional content to be rendered inside the badge.", "created_at": "2024-06-03T10:16:23Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "12e01ea4a9cb1ce7d618c03eb9efe3fffda6d7ae", "message": "chore: Add parentTicketId field to TicketFormSchema", "created_at": "2024-06-03T10:15:38Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0f1fa00cbd8625e02c3d47c8db93fc720ed96225", "message": "feat(projects): added grouping by status to smaller devices (cards)", "created_at": "2024-06-03T08:56:43Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ca15816a8ab1cb397b2fa03e9eaa16bf64dc63de", "message": "refactor: Update background and foreground colors for dark mode\n\n- Adjusted the CSS variables for the background and foreground colors in the dark mode to improve visibility and aesthetics.", "created_at": "2024-06-02T11:45:19Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "aa47caba95931c20f932f6ebdcf42d75065805b2", "message": "refactor: Improve responsiveness of ticket details header\n\n- Updated the Header component in ticket-details to handle loading state and display a skeleton loader when isLoading is true.\n- Added a Skeleton component to display a loading state for the ticket ID button.\n- Updated the onClick handler of the ticket ID button to prevent navigation when isLoading is true.", "created_at": "2024-06-02T11:44:00Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "b3c7f5a39e47f1dc2289e347374f8f40293bf1ce", "message": "refactor: Update UI styles for better responsiveness", "created_at": "2024-06-02T10:15:08Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "65476b8bac1e5d2cb21577513079a9a615851687", "message": "refactor: Update viewport meta tag for better responsiveness", "created_at": "2024-06-02T09:49:36Z", "repo": "TTS-Frontend", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "80b26e13061d27b9ec166237a33a7e968a7de3fa", "message": "refactor: Update UI styles for better responsiveness\n\n- Updated the BreadcrumbItem component to include the \"md:text-lg\" and \"text-sm\" classes for better responsiveness.\n- Removed unnecessary padding class from the main layout component.\n- Made the dialogs responsive using drawers.\n- Removed